  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Optimistic concurrency control for your resources.\n      - Validators: every response carries an entity tag and a last-modified date, so a client can say which version it read.\n      - Updates and deletes: the client must send that version back, otherwise the request is refused with 428 precondition required.\n      - Stale versions: a request built on an outdated version is rejected with 412 precondition failed, so nobody's changes are silently overwritten.\n      - Conditional reads: asking for a version that has not changed returns 304 not modified with no body.",
